  "details": "Multiple actions are bound to trackpad click, conflicting with movement controls.\n\nTrackpad L:\n\n- Click: flip\n\n- Click: Respawn\n\nTrackpad R:\n\n- Click: flight_mode\n\n- Click: take_picture\n\nMaybe consider moving these to grip and trigger, making use of different Input Methods? (Double, Hold, ect)\n\nI also can't seem to exit the large FPV mode by holding down on either stick. (Unsure if that's a L or R on the stick icon, it's too small on vive res to read)",
